WEBVTT

00:00.140 --> 00:01.800
I hate making these videos.

00:01.870 --> 00:03.950
It’s really hard to be genuine and, uh,

00:04.020 --> 00:06.030
not be like a marketing guy and

00:06.130 --> 00:07.220
just a weird vibe.

00:07.450 --> 00:09.790
AI Freelancer is my attempt

00:09.840 --> 00:10.730
to help the world

00:10.780 --> 00:11.950
benefit from AI.

00:12.170 --> 00:15.120
I think all this AI stuff is being

00:15.290 --> 00:17.490
kind of forced on the public a bit too fast.

00:17.670 --> 00:20.000
I’m honestly not wild about

00:20.100 --> 00:21.830
a lot of these AI companies

00:21.870 --> 00:24.950
and the social impacts that they are having.

00:25.120 --> 00:27.520
But there is incredible science here,

00:27.600 --> 00:29.690
and you can do so much good with the science.

00:29.830 --> 00:32.410
And I really view it as my mission
to try and help people

00:32.510 --> 00:33.710
dig deep and find

00:33.720 --> 00:35.860
what can really move the needle for them.

00:36.030 --> 00:37.140
You know, it’s not easy.

00:37.190 --> 00:38.740
There’s a million things going on.

00:38.890 --> 00:41.370
I don’t think the world has ever
been changing this fast.

00:41.500 --> 00:42.730
I don’t think people like it.

00:43.060 --> 00:44.600
I’m gonna do what I can to help, though.
